\* All TLC check configs for AntflyHAFailoverSafety.tla, one section per check.
\* Sections are verbatim TLC config syntax; the build extracts them
\* (scripts/tla-cfg.sh). Section names match the make-target check ids.

==== positive tier=fast
\* TLC config for AntflyHAFailoverSafety.tla.

SPECIFICATION FairSpec

CONSTANTS
    BuggyPromoteMissingAck = FALSE
    BuggyOldPrimaryWrite = FALSE
    BuggyAckWithoutReceipt = FALSE

INVARIANTS
    TypeOK
    AckEvidenceExists
    PromotedNodeHasAllSyncAckedWrites
    NoSplitBrainWritablePrimaries
    PromotionRequiresFence
    NoSplitBrainWrites
    Safety

PROPERTIES
    EventuallyPromoted

==== BadAckWithoutReceipt
\* Expected-failure config: a sync acknowledgement is recorded without durable
\* standby receipt evidence (ack-bookkeeping bug). Pinned to AckEvidenceExists.

SPECIFICATION Spec

CONSTANTS
    BuggyPromoteMissingAck = FALSE
    BuggyOldPrimaryWrite = FALSE
    BuggyAckWithoutReceipt = TRUE

INVARIANTS
    AckEvidenceExists

==== BadOldPrimaryWrite
\* Expected-failure config: old primary writes after a promoted standby is writable.
\* Pinned to the specific semantic invariant this mutant must violate.

SPECIFICATION Spec

CONSTANTS
    BuggyPromoteMissingAck = FALSE
    BuggyOldPrimaryWrite = TRUE
    BuggyAckWithoutReceipt = FALSE

INVARIANTS
    NoSplitBrainWrites

==== BadPromoteMissingAck
\* Expected-failure config: promote a standby that lacks a sync-acknowledged
\* write. Async-acked writes carry no preservation promise, so only the
\* sync-scoped invariant is pinned.

SPECIFICATION Spec

CONSTANTS
    BuggyPromoteMissingAck = TRUE
    BuggyOldPrimaryWrite = FALSE
    BuggyAckWithoutReceipt = FALSE

INVARIANTS
    PromotedNodeHasAllSyncAckedWrites
